  "title": "Vertiv introduces backup power for personal devices and business applications",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today introduced a new generation of compact uninterruptible power supply (UPS) systems for connected homes and workspaces. The Vertiv™ PowerUPS 200 family, available in Essential, Standard, and Premium versions with capacities from 600 to 1500 VA, combines modern design with enhanced usability for workstations, point-of-sale systems, gaming consoles, smart devices, and home entertainment setups. These 120V models are now available in North America.",
